 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Auspicious Beast Summon — Innate Technique (1st level)</em></p><blockquote><p>By covering your face you can become a medium for the spirit of the four auspicious beasts. These four beasts give you great abilities.</p></blockquote><p>Beginning at 1st level, as an action using 1 Cursed Energy, you summon a yellow drill horn for 1 minute. This horn can be used to make an additional melee Cursed Energy attack against a creature within 30 ft as part of your turn, dealing 1d6 piercing damage on a hit. The damage increases to 1d8 at 3rd level, 1d10 at 6th level, 1d12 at 11th level, and 3d6 at 18th level. You can only have one <em>Kaichi</em> at a time.</p>",
